 <article class="concept-card">
 <h3><span></span> Core Concept &amp; Mental Model</h3>
 <div class="analogy-callout">
 <strong>Real-World Analogy:</strong> An event listener is like a doorbell: it sits quietly waiting for someone to press the button, and the moment it is pressed, it rings the chime (triggers your function).
 </div>
 </article>

 <!-- ️ Core Building Blocks Guide -->
 <article class="concept-card">
 <h3><span>️</span> DOM Event Methods</h3>
